# Extension YouTube Integration Test

## Verify transcript and overlay on a YouTube video

- Navigate to YouTube video "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ypzNhwpmOD4"
- Secondary sidebar should be present
- No consent wall should appear
- Transcript should be available
- Take screenshot

